      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Try reframing the location concern as a commitment to maximizing public benefit across the *entire* city, not just one neighborhood. The goal is to sound visionary rather than parochial; you could state, \"My concern at the time was ensuring the center's location offered the greatest accessibility for the broadest possible range of residents, which led me to suggest an alternative site.\" This acknowledges the location issue while positioning him as a strategic planner focused on overall community good.",
